Package: qtl2mr
Type: Package
Title: Founder-Aware Mendelian Randomization in Multiparent Mice
Version: 0.6.0
Authors@R: person(given = "Xiaoyang", family = "Dai",
    role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "xd14188@bristol.ac.uk")
Description: Founder-aware Mendelian randomization for Diversity Outbred
    and related eight-founder mouse populations. Selected QTL are used as
    instruments represented by founder haplotype probabilities. Exposure and
    outcome founder effects are estimated with kinship-aware linear mixed
    models and combined by an overlap-aware second-order estimator with
    profile confidence sets. Instruments are selected per exposure from a QTL
    scan; one-pair analyses write tables, figures and an HTML report; batch
    analyses fit many pairs in the same way with resumable checkpoints.
